  unitName: Beast King Zegar
  unitId: 10024
  unitNumber: 320
  description: The boy once found in a jungle in the Agni Empire territory grew up.
    Rumors say that during the fierce battle with the gods, Zegar's powers grew stronger,
    producing claws of flames on his back. His incomparable strength that surpasses
    humans and beasts made him popular within the Agni Empire. Encouraged by the
    people's voices, Zegar strived to fight harder.
  summonDesc: You call me?<br>Me stronger than human and beast!<br>Me show you!
  fusionDesc: Burn more!<br>Use me claws to<br>burn everything!
  evoDesc: What you do to me!?<br>Why this burning feeling?<br>My claws are on fire!
